WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:09.098
Say the name of each picture first. Then your child says the first sound of the five pictures in job one.

3
00:00:09.548 --> 00:00:14.350
Then the last sound of the five pictures in job two. Do not help on this page.

4
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.229
Mark what was right, and add the two numbers.

5
00:00:17.679 --> 00:00:19.554
Eight or more, go on to day six.

6
00:00:20.004 --> 00:00:25.659
Fewer than eight, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

7
00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:32.297
Then play the game on the next page. Your child says each name and its first sound, and colors the step.

8
00:00:32.747 --> 00:00:36.946
At the end of the path, they turn around and come back, saying the last sounds.
